"description": "Enerpac Tool Group Corp. engages in the provision of industrial tools, services, technology and solutions. It operates through the Industrial Tools and Services and Other segments. The Industrial Tools and Services segment supplies both products and services to a broad array of end markets, including the industrial, energy, mining, and production automation markets. The Other operating segment designs and manufactures synthetic ropes and biomedical assemblies. The company was founded in 1910 and is headquartered in Milwaukee, WI.",
